@startuml
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam backgroundColor white

title Alternativa B (Descartada): SismoReporta AQP con Microservicios

actor "Ciudadano / Brigadista" as U
node "API Gateway / Nginx" as GW

package "Microservicios Independientes" {
    [Servicio Ingesta] as S1
    [Servicio GIS & Mapas] as S2
    [Servicio Brigadas] as S3
    [Servicio Notificaciones] as S4
}

queue "Apache Kafka Broker" as KAFKA

database "BD Ingesta" as DB1
database "BD GIS (PostGIS)" as DB2
database "BD Brigadas" as DB3

cloud "Proveedor SMS / WhatsApp" as EXT

U --> GW
GW --> S1
GW --> S2
GW --> S3

S1 --> DB1
S2 --> DB2
S3 --> DB3

S1 ..> KAFKA : Evento: ReporteCreado
KAFKA ..> S2
KAFKA ..> S4
S4 --> EXT

note bottom of KAFKA
  **Alternativa Descartada (Puntaje: 2.80 en Matriz)**
  Razón: Alta complejidad de despliegue, monitoreo distribuido 
  y costo elevado de infraestructura. Imposible de construir 
  y operar con 3 desarrolladores en 1 mes.
end note
@enduml
